_ui7zxEJgj8Q7kNvwEMcqz3&_nc_oc=AdrpzlTe3p5iUgQx020SljdFK8iFrBgtfKFWNdt_QW1CAXx-EPaYBgrd2OITHnMCW-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyySxBEppuMDwLV5BjRFchwIuh1CbXB-1GExQK1-9jLdg&oe=69CD2837"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=alSpBlvgqCUQ7kNvwEjqzSZ&_nc_oc=Ado-xwP_O2zBJPthTH81FgncOJLf4pGBHx-GeJdq7nktWWEKqwkPvsJxZT7NT5SdiIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzIakA_xk5Kg2zkgjm_C0CXMpPtycuAJ-IgzYTSW75huA&oe=69CD29CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7uE4qaw6W8QQ7kNvwE6SIX1&_nc_oc=Adr_z7-QI9nrfllAFMJJtaSkJinBkS65SfWfMXM9CQ3jHsOQ4XWpi5cPkJILCmuEdR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyXiLL_48NIr_QzvfvG5CoF7uCiBmMWEGO1RclZTzGkhg&oe=69CD16EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mYqOlAc5m1wQ7kNvwHPBhyQ&_nc_oc=AdrPClMagQpRXiJv6X6ICQASLUzSVonA8ualq6VTasiiEvfi2E2u35k6sY5IktSisnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyQFtAWb4wMeyFyP822MYWvF6Svpkieo2JS6XVBOtT7zw&oe=69CD0043"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qz77PSupZ0Q7kNvwEqD8ld&_nc_oc=Adq51sDl-qUwF5sbrKkMOLhJhL2QCG-y5qHTMWYlQRhjQMIPTcr9QFvcXO306-K3114&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzdeJNApzUvqFqLAhN_OFkVth4c2XkpA-QWB0qAgJ2CHg&oe=69CD30D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rKcayQ_QjS0Q7kNvwHIC2t5&_nc_oc=AdrNbAykc2gYBmOf1bKbYltkBxM2wPNuVGHHNda-nHPfsbnJBZ_IDceX-XGr2UaWLBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afztf8IaS4nROlh1iL-dQO9s4W8GGpg9Bvchp4Hm__8gvw&oe=69CD0BBC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080